<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-084" chapter-id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family" source-id="s-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family-ws2837495">
  <p id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p001:m0000" ref="2f0_e77_32c">劉牢之</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p001:m0005" ref="2f0_e77_32c">道堅</persName>，彭城人也。曾祖<persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p001:m0015" ref="79e_zuf_ync">羲</persName>，以善射事武帝，曆北地、雁門太守。父<persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p001:m0034" ref="nl3_v2w_t8o">建</persName>，有武幹，為征虜將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p002:m0000" ref="2f0_e77_32c">牢之</persName>遣其婿<persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p002:m0005" ref="3mo_ush_dt8">高雅之</persName>、子<persName id="c-jinshu-084-liulaozhi-family:p002:m0010" ref="er7_nw6_n6w">敬宣</persName>，</p>
</text>
